<title>SPAIN: Spain Apr CPI unchanged vs March, yr/yr up 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Apr CPI unchanged vs March, yr/yr up 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute</p>
<p>(INE) gave the following figures:</p>
<p> SPANISH INFLATION		APR 97    MAR 97   APR 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change	0.0	 0.1	0.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year rise		 1.7	 2.2	3.5</p>
<p> Core inflation		    0.1	 0.2	0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year rise		 1.9	 2.1	3.9</p>
<p> INDEX BY COMPONENTS	     APR 97     MAR 97     YR/YR</p>
<p> Food				  -0.2	 -0.3	  0.0</p>
<p> Clothing			     0.4	  0.1	  2.0</p>
<p> Housing				0.2	  0.1	  3.0</p>
<p> Household goods		    0.2	  0.2	  1.9</p>
<p> Medicine			     0.3	 -0.1	  3.1</p>
<p> Transport			    0.0	  0.0	  1.8</p>
<p> Culture				0.0	  0.1	  2.0</p>
<p> Other				  0.1	  0.7	  3.0</p>
<p>Note - In food, fresh food fell 0.1 pct from the previous month (up 0.2 pct year-on-year) and processed food fell 0.3 (down 0.2 pct year-on-year)</p>
</text>
